<title>USA: TABLE - VALUE CITY JULY SAME-STORE SALES UP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - VALUE CITY JULY SAME-STORE SALES UP.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ohio 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1997	 1996	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$68.3	$62.5	+9.3	 +0.4</p>
<p>Year-to-date  $1,073.0     $939.2     +14.3	 +0.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>Year to date is 52 weeks ended August 2, 1997. Including the additional week in last year's period, sales for the 52 weeks ended August 2, 1997, increased 12.5 percent to $1.073 billion from $954.3 million reported last year for the 53 weeks ended August 3, 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Value City Department Stores Inc.</p>
